          "I’ll need part of the money this year",
          "I might withdraw occasionally, but most will stay long term",
          "I won’t use this money for at least 3 years"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "What is your level of financial knowledge?",
        "options": [
          "None",
          "I understand the difference between stocks and fixed income",
          "I’m familiar with different investment options and their risks",
          "I have deep knowledge of investment products and strategies"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "What have you invested in before?",
        "options": [
          "Savings account, time deposits and/or fixed income instruments",
          "Mutual funds",
          "Stocks",
          "Derivatives"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Which of the following statements best represents you?",
        "options": [
          "I prefer stable growth and avoid losses",
          "I accept short-term losses under 1 year",
          "I care about long-term returns without big losses",
          "I accept high volatility in exchange for long-term gains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "If your investment gains 30% and then drops 20%, leaving a 10% profit, what would you do?",
        "options": [
          "Move to risk-free assets",
          "Shift part of it to lower-risk investments",
          "Feel worried but take no action",
          "Invest more if fundamentals support it"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "What is your approximate monthly net income?",
        "options": [
          "Less than 1 million CLP",
          "Between 1 and 3 million CLP",
          "Between 3 and 5 million CLP",
          "More than 5 million CLP"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "How much of your savings are you willing to invest?",
        "options": [
          "Less than 30%",
          "Between 30% and 60%",
          "More than 60%"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Is your profession related to finance?",
        "options": [
          "Strongly related",
          "Somewhat related",
          "Slightly related",
          "Not related"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "What is your estimated investable net worth?",
